          "content": "By the end of this unit, explain the central mechanisms without confusing a measured marker with a complete cell fate. Interpret a worked numerical example with appropriate units, design a control to separate two alternative causes, and identify the species, tissue and developmental stage to which the evidence applies. Prerequisites include basic cell biology, genetics, gene expression, membrane signaling and elementary mathematical modeling. Calculus and statistical reasoning strengthen the advanced exercises, but each quantitative example includes the numerical relationship used.",
